title: Implement command hook executor (spawn, stdin JSON, timeout)
updated_at: "2026-08-02T04:22:14Z"
---
Core executor using Lwt_process: spawn shell command, write event JSON to stdin, capture stdout/stderr, enforce timeout via Lwt_unix.timeout. Return HookResult with exit_code, stdout, stderr. Handle process cleanup on timeout (kill process group).